Whenever I see grilled meat,

20
00:01:03,799 --> 00:01:05,120
I think of that night

21
00:01:05,200 --> 00:01:05,840
My dad

22
00:01:07,400 --> 00:01:09,079
What exactly happened that night?

23
00:01:09,959 --> 00:01:11,359
My dad killed someone

24
00:01:11,640 --> 00:01:13,640
My dad killed someone, did you know that?

25
00:01:15,280 --> 00:01:16,519
He killed someone

26
00:01:18,599 --> 00:01:19,120
He...

27
00:01:19,480 --> 00:01:20,400
Zihao

28
00:01:20,400 --> 00:01:21,120
Don't be afraid, don't be afraid

29
00:01:21,400 --> 00:01:22,239
Mom's here

30
00:01:22,239 --> 00:01:23,400
He killed someone

31
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:25,000
Don't be afraid, don't be afraid

32
