Zihao, don't be afraid

37
00:01:34,680 --> 00:01:35,319
Don't be afraid

38
00:01:35,799 --> 00:01:36,439
Don't be afraid

39
00:01:37,799 --> 00:01:38,959
Zihao, don't be afraid

40
00:01:47,640 --> 00:01:48,640
Where are you going?

41
00:01:49,400 --> 00:01:51,920
Let go, let go of me

42
00:01:53,719 --> 00:01:56,040
You live, eat, and dress on my dime

43
00:01:56,439 --> 00:01:57,519
Now that the tide is turning,

44
00:01:57,519 --> 00:01:58,439
you want to run away

45
00:01:58,439 --> 00:01:59,319
Why?

46
00:02:00,439 --> 00:02:01,680
Let go of me

47
00:02:01,920 --> 00:02:03,599
If you've got the guts, take it out on Uncle Fat!

48
00:02:03,760 --> 00:02:05,359
Everyone's backing Liang Zhiqiang now

49
00:02:05,439 --> 00:02:07,879
You're lucky I haven't sold you out

50
00:02:08,080 --> 00:02:09,240
Quit acting crazy here!

51
00:02:10,680 --> 00:02:11,719
Say that again

52
00:02:13,360 --> 00:02:14,759
What gives you the right to hit me?

53
00:02:15,800 --> 00:02:18,560
Your brothers disown you, the elders want you gone

54
00:02:18,560 --> 00:02:19,479
You!

55
00:02:19,719 --> 00:02:22,159
You're only fit to play tough with me now!

56
00:02:26,680 --> 00:02:27,840
All you can do is hit women

57
00:02:27,840 --> 00:02:29,599
If you've got the guts, go hit Liang Zhiqiang

58
00:02:30,639 --> 00:02:32,039
I must have been blind

59
00:02:32,039 --> 00:02:33,840
to have ended up with a man like you

60
00:02:34,319 --> 00:02:36,599
Haven't I been devoted enough to you?

61
00:02:36,639 --> 00:02:38,360
I've been with you since I was 18

62
00:02:38,439 --> 00:02:40,439
I even wanted to bear you a son

63
00:02:40,639 --> 00:02:41,639
And what did I get?

64
00:02:42,199 --> 00:02:43,639
You can't even have kids!

65
00:02:43,639 --> 00:02:44,479
You're the one with the problem

66
00:02:44,479 --> 00:02:45,680
Do you even know that?

67
00:02:46,560 --> 00:02:47,560
Heaven

68
00:02:48,039 --> 00:02:51,080
Heaven wants you to die without an heir

69
00:02:55,240 --> 00:02:56,479
What the hell are you saying?

70
00:02:56,680 --> 00:02:58,080
My son is already 20 years old

71
00:03:01,800 --> 00:03:03,280
Xie Zihao

72
00:03:03,759 --> 00:03:06,039
You really trust Zheng Baojiao that much?

73
00:03:06,479 --> 00:03:07,680
Let me tell you the truth

74
00:03:08,080 --> 00:03:11,159
Xie Zihao isn't your son at all

75
00:03:26,520 --> 00:03:27,919
Not only did you hand over the boss's seat

76
00:03:27,919 --> 00:03:29,000
to Liang Zhiqiang,

77
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:30,840
you raised another man's son for free.

78
00:03:30,840 --> 00:03:32,280
All these years,

79
00:03:32,400 --> 00:03:35,240
you've really been such a saint!

80
00:03:36,800 --> 00:03:38,319
Do you even know

81
00:03:38,319 --> 00:03:40,479
who truly cares about you?

82
00:03:40,520 --> 00:03:43,120
You idiot, you idiot, you idiot!

83
00:03:43,120 --> 00:03:45,479
You idiot, you idiot!

84
00:03:47,240 --> 00:03:48,400
You listen to me carefully.

85
00:03:49,199 --> 00:03:50,280
He is my son.

86
00:03:50,800 --> 00:03:52,520
He will always be my son.

87
00:03:52,759 --> 00:03:53,840
Do you hear me?

88
00:04:05,439 --> 00:04:07,199
I went to meet someone today

89
00:04:08,400 --> 00:04:11,159
At first I wanted to see what made her so special

90
00:04:12,439 --> 00:04:13,560
But I realized

91
00:04:14,639 --> 00:04:17,600
Next to her, I felt like nothing at all

92
00:04:18,920 --> 00:04:20,879
For the first time, someone told me

93
00:04:21,319 --> 00:04:22,600
that I still had a choice

94
00:04:25,800 --> 00:04:27,000
I think I understand now

95
00:04:27,199 --> 00:04:28,959
why A Qiang fell in love with her

96
00:04:31,519 --> 00:04:32,480
She was right

97
00:04:34,279 --> 00:04:35,680
I should have left a long time ago

98
00:04:36,639 --> 00:04:38,720
I should have taken Zihao and gone

99
00:04:39,439 --> 00:04:41,279
My life is already what it is

100
00:04:43,839 --> 00:04:45,240
But Zihao is still young

101
00:04:47,000 --> 00:04:48,399
I can't let Xie Guanhong

102
00:04:48,399 --> 00:04:49,839
ruin his whole life

103
00:04:52,040 --> 00:04:53,680
You never belonged in this world.

104
00:04:54,439 --> 00:04:55,879
You should never have gotten involved.

105
00:04:58,279 --> 00:04:59,519
For people in our line of work

106
00:05:00,279 --> 00:05:01,639
even setting one foot inside

107
00:05:02,360 --> 00:05:04,319
means gambling your life every single day

108
00:05:05,680 --> 00:05:07,160
And once you get blood on your hands,

109
00:05:08,079 --> 00:05:09,600
there's no turning back

110
00:05:09,959 --> 00:05:11,759
Then why did you choose this path?

111
00:05:15,879 --> 00:05:16,680
It doesn't matter

112
00:05:22,519 --> 00:05:23,480
What matters is

113
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:25,360
we're already tainted

114
00:05:26,240 --> 00:05:27,360
But Zihao isn't

115
00:05:28,120 --> 00:05:29,360
Zihao still has a choice

116
00:05:30,480 --> 00:05:32,279
He can't become the next suspect.

117
00:05:33,720 --> 00:05:36,079
So we can't make a wrong move here.

118
00:05:41,199 --> 00:05:44,639
Right now you really look like a cop

119
00:05:52,560 --> 00:05:53,319
Fine

120
00:05:53,879 --> 00:05:56,399
Then let's say I really am a cop

121
00:05:57,000 --> 00:05:59,959
Are you willing to cooperate for leniency

122
00:05:59,959 --> 00:06:01,079
and testify against Xie Guanhong?

123
00:06:13,120 --> 00:06:14,639
No matter who I really am

124
00:06:15,279 --> 00:06:17,199
I'll always protect you and your son.

125
00:06:22,759 --> 00:06:23,600
Thank you

126
00:06:26,639 --> 00:06:28,480
Thank you for being by my side

127
00:06:29,560 --> 00:06:31,759
For making me feel I'm not alone

128
00:06:40,279 --> 00:06:41,959
Uncle Fat, you never change

129
00:06:43,279 --> 00:06:44,920
Always so cautious

130
00:06:46,759 --> 00:06:48,920
Asking to meet me in a place like this

131
00:06:49,160 --> 00:06:49,800
What?

132
00:06:50,279 --> 00:06:51,079
Don't trust me?

133
00:06:52,360 --> 00:06:53,519
No, no

134
00:06:54,040 --> 00:06:56,399
Can never be too careful.

135
00:06:59,399 --> 00:07:00,199
Ah Hong

136
00:07:01,319 --> 00:07:04,439
I watched you climb your way to the top

137
00:07:05,000 --> 00:07:08,399
You're truly capable and hardworking

138
00:07:08,920 --> 00:07:10,439
Ruthless enough to get things done

139
00:07:11,920 --> 00:07:13,759
I've seen it all

140
00:07:16,240 --> 00:07:19,639
But a man must know when to step back

141
00:07:20,240 --> 00:07:22,000
The reason I called you here today

142
00:07:22,399 --> 00:07:23,879
is really quite simple

143
00:07:24,680 --> 00:07:27,720
For the sake of our old friendship

144
00:07:28,199 --> 00:07:29,560
I'm giving you one more chance

145
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:33,279
Your company

146
00:07:33,759 --> 00:07:35,839
is already on the cops' radar

147
00:07:36,839 --> 00:07:38,199
Your underground banks

148
00:07:38,199 --> 00:07:41,600
and those nightclubs have all been shut down

149
00:07:43,240 --> 00:07:45,519
Do you know how worried we are?

150
00:07:45,720 --> 00:07:48,839
You'll drag the whole society down with you

151
00:07:49,920 --> 00:07:50,839
If you keep

152
00:07:50,839 --> 00:07:52,639
clinging to that position

153
00:07:52,639 --> 00:07:54,079
you'll drag all the brothers

154
00:07:54,079 --> 00:07:55,480
down to die with you

155
00:07:59,279 --> 00:08:01,279
The cops won't find a thing

156
00:08:01,600 --> 00:08:03,399
I hid all the evidence long ago

157
00:08:04,360 --> 00:08:06,000
There's nothing they can do to me

158
00:08:06,959 --> 00:08:08,680
Easy for you to say

159
00:08:09,120 --> 00:08:11,079
Don't be so naive

160
00:08:11,759 --> 00:08:14,240
There are plenty of brothers in the society now

161
00:08:14,240 --> 00:08:15,600
who don't respect you anymore

162
00:08:16,240 --> 00:08:18,600
You just want to stay the boss, don't you?

163
00:08:18,600 --> 00:08:19,399
What a joke

164
00:08:19,759 --> 00:08:21,879
How many brothers will still follow you?

165
00:08:22,120 --> 00:08:23,480
Have you ever thought about that?

166
00:08:23,480 --> 00:08:24,600
Oh, I've thought about it

167
00:08:30,120 --> 00:08:32,080
I've wondered if you've gone senile

168
00:08:33,120 --> 00:08:34,480
Every one of them wants me dead

169
00:08:35,240 --> 00:08:38,320
What have you old bastards ever done?

170
00:08:38,919 --> 00:08:40,960
Still think you're the big shots?

171
00:08:41,840 --> 00:08:44,679
Freeloading in the society's name

172
00:08:44,879 --> 00:08:47,000
I'm the one who makes the money for this outfit

173
00:08:47,399 --> 00:08:48,320
If it weren't for me

174
00:08:48,480 --> 00:08:49,559
you'd all be finished

175
00:08:51,679 --> 00:08:52,600
Why are you now

176
00:08:52,600 --> 00:08:54,279
like a powder keg, ready to blow at a spark?

177
00:08:55,120 --> 00:08:56,879
That's no way for a boss to act

178
00:09:01,399 --> 00:09:03,279
Just hand over the dragon-head staff

179
00:09:04,000 --> 00:09:06,039
and leave the rest to me

180
00:09:07,919 --> 00:09:09,919
A Qiang will take over your position

181
00:09:10,120 --> 00:09:11,679
A Qiang is your brother

182
00:09:11,799 --> 00:09:13,120
You know him well

183
00:09:14,440 --> 00:09:16,240
He's cautious and sensible

184
00:09:16,840 --> 00:09:18,240
He knows his limits

185
00:09:18,919 --> 00:09:21,039
Give A Qiang your seat

186
00:09:21,679 --> 00:09:23,720
and retire gracefully

187
00:09:24,200 --> 00:09:25,279
When word gets out

188
00:09:25,279 --> 00:09:26,720
you'll save face too

189
00:09:28,840 --> 00:09:31,799
A Qiang this, A Qiang that

190
00:09:33,039 --> 00:09:34,279
What do you take him for?

191
00:09:34,720 --> 00:09:35,799
A savior?

192
00:09:36,799 --> 00:09:37,919
A superman?

193
00:09:39,000 --> 00:09:41,840
I'm the one who's held Heyisheng together this long

194
00:09:43,120 --> 00:09:44,879
You keep saying you held it together

195
00:09:45,000 --> 00:09:47,039
With what, exactly?

196
00:09:47,519 --> 00:09:49,919
The society doesn't belong to you alone

197
00:09:50,240 --> 00:09:52,919
Generations bled to build it up

198
00:09:54,159 --> 00:09:56,679
One wrong step and everything went wrong

199
00:09:57,320 --> 00:09:59,320
And now you want to drag us all

200
00:09:59,639 --> 00:10:01,399
down into the grave with you?

201
00:10:17,799 --> 00:10:19,279
I understand, Uncle Fat.

202
00:10:22,159 --> 00:10:23,200
I'm so sorry.

203
00:10:24,080 --> 00:10:25,200
I'm out of time.

204
00:11:35,320 --> 00:11:36,120
Ah Hong!

205
00:11:36,320 --> 00:11:37,600
Open the door for me!

206
00:11:39,759 --> 00:11:42,080
Ah Hong, open the door for me!

207
00:11:43,039 --> 00:11:44,559
Can you hear me, Ah Hong?

208
00:11:44,559 --> 00:11:46,320
Why are you just standing there?

209
00:11:46,879 --> 00:11:49,399
Go get the keys and open the door!

210
00:11:49,399 --> 00:11:50,240
Ah Hong!

211
00:11:51,440 --> 00:11:53,440
I'm begging you, Ah Hong!

212
00:11:53,840 --> 00:11:54,960
Open the door for me!

213
00:11:55,399 --> 00:11:56,799
Open the door for me!

214
00:11:59,440 --> 00:12:00,360
Ah Hong!

215
00:12:03,480 --> 00:12:04,799
Ah Hong!

216
00:12:16,879 --> 00:12:18,320
Uncle Fat, you're too sentimental

217
00:12:19,120 --> 00:12:20,720
You're no longer fit for the underworld.
